                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97f13213-767b-4bf2-b2a0-60f21ebb12c1",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d01cf3-108d-3c43-83e5-157a141d7b3f",
                                                "text": "In the English words didn’t, that’s, and wanna, the endings -n’t, -’s, and -a arose by contraction."
